Author: Jian Qin [aut, cre], Chunbo Huang [aut], Shulan Sun [aut], Shaoqiang Wang [aut], Changhui Peng [aut]
Description: This package can simulate GPP by coupling SIF, using a more precise ecological process. The out of TRIPLEX_SIF function include a table of long format data frame, two scatterplots of simulated GPP at 30-min scale during the entire studied period and in four seasons, two graphs of diurnal dynamics at 30 min scale, and three graph of monthly variations in input environmental variables.
